Upstream models

Procezio sends prompts to an OpenAI-compatible endpoint that you configure and hold the key
for - a local Ollama or LM Studio instance, a hosted provider, or a proxy of your own. The
lab does not train, fine-tune or distribute models, and is not a provider of a general-purpose
AI model under the EU AI Act; obligations for the model itself rest with whoever provides it,
under their own terms. Output drafted through that endpoint is marked per Article 50. See
COMPLIANCE.md.

